{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04311","headline":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山 · 于季子","name":"奉和圣制夏日游石淙山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九旗云布临嵩室，万骑星陈集颍川。\n瑞液含滋登禹膳，飞流荐响入虞弦。\n山扉野径朝花积，帐殿帷宫夏叶连。\n微臣献寿迎千寿，愿奉尧年倚万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"于季子","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04311.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04311","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}